<servinfosub id = "AENLBA0C9B06013003" page = "2">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<attention3>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before conducting any weld, check installation position and condition for installation part(s).
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Side body outside: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04006"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Side body inside: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04007"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Proceed repair while taking into consideration installation of parts that affect appearance. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B04003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install rear door hinge retainers (2 pcs.).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld or plug weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0080.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "120.432mm" ver = "01" gw = "179" gh = "325"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install center pillar inner panel.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct resistance spot weld and plug weld.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFBA0A9B0131.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "101.147mm" ver = "01" gw = "215" gh = "270"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
