<s1>
<ptxt>
Install new B-pillar outer panel to vehicle body and cut in stacked condition.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Repair the position of B-pillar outer panel where foamed material had been filled. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLBA0C9B06024"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install B-pillar outer panel to vehicle body.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct plug weld or resistance spot weld and fillet weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Conduct continuous weld.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Apply anti-corrosion wax to back side of continuous weld part.
</ptxt>
